 ours exploration at The Tech Interactive. On Thursday\, Oct. 8\, from 7 to
  11 p.m.\, discover the art and science behind your favorite pour with tas
 tings from local breweries\, hands-on activities\, and conversations with 
 the people who know beer best. Then grab a drink\, catch a DJ set\, explor
 e The Tech’s exhibits after dark\, and discover a different side of down
 town San Jose nightlife. What to Expect Geek out over fermentation\, flavo
 r\, and the science inside your glass. Your night includes: – Beer tasti
 ngs from local breweries including Fox Tale Fermentation Project\, Clandes
 tine Brewing\, Hapas Brewing Company\, DTSJ Brewing Co.\, Fathers Brewing\
 , and more – Beer Spherification Lab led by The Tech Interactive staff 
 – Science of Beer demonstrations and talks with brewers – Music and so
 unds curated by Universal Grammar’s Zuri Alexa – An Innovator Vendor M
 arket featuring South Bay makers and artisans – Full access to The Tech 
 Interactive’s hands-on exhibits and workshops Whether you’re a beer ne
 rd\, science geek\, curious tinkerer\, or just looking for something diffe
 rent to do with
